  "description": "Please Note: USB Cable Sold Separately The Uwell Viscore 8000 Prefilled Pod Vape Kit brings cutting-edge vaping technology together with effortless functionality, making it a perfect choice for vapers of all levels. Powered by a long-lasting 1900mAh rechargeable battery, this sleek, lightweight device is capable of delivering up to 8000 puffs per kit, depending upon personal usage. The Viscore 8000 also features two selectable modes in addition to Standard: ECO Mode for conserving battery life and Super Mode for enhanced flavour and vapour intensity, providing a tailored vaping experience that puts you in control. To change modes tap the charging port three times in 1.5s to switch between modes. The kit includes a 2ml prefilled pod paired with a 10ml refill container, offering unmatched value and extended usability. Each pod features a 0.8ohm mesh coil, designed for mouth-to-lung (MTL) vaping, ensuring bold, full-bodied flavours, and satisfying vapour production with every puff. Built with convenience and sustainability in mind, the Viscore 8000 features a USB-C fast-charging port for quick recharges and a visible battery level indicator for easy monitoring. The pods are made with durable, translucent materials, allowing for effortless e-liquid level checks while minimising leaks. For a long-lasting, flavour-packed vape that’s as easy to use as it is satisfying, the Uwell Viscore 8000 Prefilled Pod Kit is a fantastic choice for vapers on the go. Flavours Available: Choose from 10 flavours all in 20mg strength. Blue Razz Lemonade Blueberry Sour Raspberry Cherry Cola Cherry Ice Lemon & Lime Pineapple Ice Pink Lemonade Strawberry Ice Watermelon Ice Watermelon Strawberry Please Note: 8000 puffs is an estimate subject to personal usage and vaping style. Shop Uwell Viscore 8000 Refill Pods",
